@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/sample
@dummyAuth = Basic ZHVtbXk6ZHVtbXk=

### Listar todos os proprietários
GET {{baseUrl}}/Owners
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Criar novo proprietário
POST {{baseUrl}}/Owners
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

{
  "firstName": "Kel",
  "lastName": "Oliveira",
  "phone": "11987654321",
  "email": "kel.oliveira@email.com"
}

### Buscar proprietário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Owners(ID=7bab5455-4d11-47f3-88b9-bf53a6e409e0)
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}


### Atualizar proprietário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/Owners(id=79a80ca2-6fbc-4157-8e6f-12ba3dab7b78)
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

{
  "phone": "11977593282"
}

### Remover proprietário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Owners(ID=79a80ca2-6fbc-4157-8e6f-12ba3dab7b78) // esta dando erro
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Listar proprietários com pets expandidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/Owners?$expand=pets
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}
